WEBVTT

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:30.280
Kenma.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.550
You Are Defeated

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:38.010
That looks pretty tough.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:42.990
Somewhat. But I'm getting the hang of it,

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:45.770
so if I play for about thirty more hours...

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:47.730
I'm surprised you don't get bored.

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:51.190
If you have that much time on
your hands, let's practice volleyball.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:52.650
I am, though.

00:00:53.160 --> 00:00:56.520
That's why we're here at school
on a Sunday morning, right?

00:00:58.120 --> 00:01:02.080
Nekoma
Municipal
High School

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:02.080
Well, we did lose the Inter-High prelims.

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:06.040
The Spring Tournament prelims
are just around the corner.

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:09.590
You never get sick of
volleyball, huh, Kuroo?

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:15.160
Ah, Kuroo-san, Kenma-san, morning!

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:16.470
Morning!

00:01:16.840 --> 00:01:17.840
Mornin'!

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:18.810
Morning.

00:01:18.810 --> 00:01:20.570
Is everyone already here?

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:22.350
Well...

00:01:24.760 --> 00:01:28.560
I am the wind, because I am
as fast as the wind.

00:01:28.560 --> 00:01:33.400
I always tell first-years to
show up early. That little bastard.

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:39.410
I am a tree, because I am quiet as a tree.

00:01:39.710 --> 00:01:43.450
Well, it's actually pretty quiet
and nice when he's not around.

00:01:45.080 --> 00:01:48.040
I'm sure he's slacking off again somewhere.

00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:50.620
He's like a stray cat.

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:55.960
And I am graceful...

00:01:58.900 --> 00:02:00.220
as a cat!

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:07.350
Mornin'!

00:02:08.050 --> 00:02:10.410
The bigwig finally shows up.

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:14.530
Haiba Lev has arrived!

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:16.280
Yeah!

00:02:17.530 --> 00:02:23.950
Haikyu!!

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:23.950
— Lev Appears! —

00:02:36.450 --> 00:02:39.470
They all seem ready to go.

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:49.820
You dumbass! I told you not to try to
get that with your arms, you beanpole!

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:52.440
I'll get the next one! One more time!

00:02:53.170 --> 00:02:56.650
Haiba Lev's got good instincts.

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:00.590
He's half-Russian and so has been
blessed with height,

00:03:00.590 --> 00:03:03.400
long limbs, and excellent athletic ability.

00:03:03.800 --> 00:03:07.670
Any of those things would set him apart
from the Japanese players...

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:06.620
Bring it!

00:03:12.580 --> 00:03:14.960
I did it! I did it! See? I did it!

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:15.640
Did you see that?

00:03:15.640 --> 00:03:17.000
You dumbass! Keep your eyes forward!

00:03:21.380 --> 00:03:24.440
Lev!

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:28.640
But he's got <i>that</i> personality,
and he's still learning the basics.

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:29.080
I keep telling you not to let your
guard down after you hit the ball?!

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:31.690
There's plenty we have yet to teach him.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.600
Sorry!

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:36.360
But we're dealing with the
Spring Tournament prelims.

00:03:36.840 --> 00:03:38.940
Things will probably get very interesting.

00:03:40.560 --> 00:03:42.410
This ain't good.

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:50.780
That was close, right?

00:03:51.320 --> 00:03:52.250
No.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:53.710
Whoa, really?!

00:03:54.000 --> 00:03:55.400
That wasn't close at all.

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:56.540
Really?!

00:03:57.790 --> 00:03:59.450
Can we try again?

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:00.200
No.

00:04:00.200 --> 00:04:01.340
Why not?!

00:04:01.340 --> 00:04:03.400
Because you're just going to miss again.

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:10.760
All right, that's all for today.

00:04:11.270 --> 00:04:13.230
Nekoma

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:20.630
It's not going where I want.

00:04:21.180 --> 00:04:25.160
But you've gotten way better,
considering you only started in high school.

00:04:25.940 --> 00:04:27.790
If you were this good in April,

00:04:27.790 --> 00:04:31.410
you could've gone to the
Battle of the Garbage Dump, too.

00:04:31.800 --> 00:04:36.520
Well, I don't need to hurry.
I'll become the ace in no time.

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:37.980
What was that?!

00:04:38.760 --> 00:04:40.940
You gonna fight me for it?

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:46.930
Let's settle this with volleyball, Senpai.

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:53.900
Wait, did I say something weird?

00:04:53.900 --> 00:04:55.640
Gather round!

00:04:57.010 --> 00:05:01.360
Two Saturdays from now,
we're going to welcome our neighbors,

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:03.740
Kunihira High School,
and do a practice match.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:06.880
At this time of year?

00:05:06.880 --> 00:05:09.780
But our training camp with
Fukurodani is coming up, too.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:11.740
That's rare.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:14.220
And...

00:05:15.050 --> 00:05:18.420
Lev, you're going to play in that match.

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:20.880
What?!

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:24.470
Really?! Just leave it to me!

00:05:24.930 --> 00:05:30.620
Er, but Coach, Lev's still having problems
getting tosses, so I'm not sure if he's...

00:05:30.620 --> 00:05:31.430
Kenma...

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:35.150
Make some time and give Lev some tosses.

00:05:35.150 --> 00:05:36.650
I can't.

00:05:36.650 --> 00:05:38.650
What do you mean you can't?!

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:42.220
That's all. Do your best.

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:45.700
Thank you!

00:05:51.620 --> 00:05:52.820
You heard him.

00:05:53.350 --> 00:05:56.760
But, sir! Why Lev?

00:05:56.760 --> 00:06:00.730
Inuoka's progressing nicely, and the
team is settling pretty well.

00:06:00.730 --> 00:06:05.050
Not to mention, Inuoka managed
to stop Karasuno's #10!

00:06:05.050 --> 00:06:07.880
This isn't anything against Inuoka.

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:11.370
We have less than two months until
the Spring Tournament prelims.

00:06:11.370 --> 00:06:16.470
It's probably safer if we concentrate
on solidifying our team.

00:06:17.320 --> 00:06:18.560
Safe?

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:21.420
We lost at the Inter-High prelims.

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:25.320
Should've seen this coming.

00:06:24.020 --> 00:06:27.740
We need to figure out what
to do to move forward.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:27.740
You're so cocky.

00:06:28.210 --> 00:06:31.510
I wonder what our boys will choose.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:36.890
Let's do this!

00:06:45.160 --> 00:06:46.710
The spot he steps...

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:50.380
The height of his jump...

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:54.430
The size of his back swing...

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:55.580
So...

00:06:57.350 --> 00:06:58.100
It's probably here.

00:06:58.520 --> 00:07:00.560
Good. A perfect toss.

00:07:06.680 --> 00:07:08.570
Hey, it went in.

00:07:10.230 --> 00:07:11.930
Nice headbutt!

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:13.490
That was my personal
time difference attack!

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:18.200
Yeah, he's definitely
some kind of special...

00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:21.720
All of you, stop gawking at
him and get to practicing!

00:07:21.720 --> 00:07:22.290
Right!

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:29.470
Magazines • Documents
Accepted here

00:07:26.340 --> 00:07:29.470
It's gotta be rough dealing with Lev.

00:07:30.020 --> 00:07:35.200
Yeah. I haven't dealt with him
much ever since he joined.

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:38.930
I can imagine. You two
are like oil and water.

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:37.930
I'm starving!

00:07:39.210 --> 00:07:41.980
It's hard to see you two meshing together.

00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:44.700
Just watch.

00:07:45.560 --> 00:07:48.330
I'll be ready by our next match.

00:07:51.010 --> 00:07:54.540
Seriously, where the hell does
your confidence come from?

00:07:55.300 --> 00:07:58.700
I'll work even harder so
I can become a starter!

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:01.910
Well, I'm gonna be the ace,
not a starter!

00:08:02.170 --> 00:08:06.440
You don't call someone who can't
play any defense an "ace!"

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:11.000
But if I work hard these next
two weeks with Kenma-san...

00:08:11.000 --> 00:08:12.130
Right?

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:17.530
It's hard to set the ball for you
because you're so sloppy.

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:20.100
It's not like I'm Karasuno's setter.

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:22.100
Huh? Who's that?

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:24.880
They're our eternal rivals
I talked about yesterday.

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:26.490
You know, the Battle of the Garbage Dump.

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:29.470
Ah, Karasuno or whatever from Miyagi.

00:08:29.470 --> 00:08:33.080
They have some insane first-years there.

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:35.500
A middle-blocker shrimp that
hits with his eyes closed

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:37.920
and a setter that can perfectly match him.

00:08:37.920 --> 00:08:39.080
Huh...

00:08:40.050 --> 00:08:43.410
That shrimp doesn't have
any of the basics down.

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.750
Is he shrimpier than you, Yaku-san?

00:08:49.970 --> 00:08:52.420
The one thing you should
never say to Yaku-san.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.130
But if that guy's a starter, then I can...

00:08:57.080 --> 00:09:00.000
I think you suck more than he does, Lev.

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.640
Huh?!

00:09:02.080 --> 00:09:04.640
I wonder how they're doing.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:12.650
Heal

00:09:11.610 --> 00:09:12.650
You Are Defeated

00:09:12.960 --> 00:09:15.110
Damn it! I lost again!

00:09:15.550 --> 00:09:17.960
Whatcha doin', Tanaka-san?

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:20.720
Playing the game
I borrowed from my sister.

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:23.080
Oh, that super popular one.

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:27.840
Come on, Tanaka. Someone who works
at the school is right in front of you.

00:09:27.840 --> 00:09:29.790
Put the game away.

00:09:30.530 --> 00:09:31.670
Huh?

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:35.170
Sakanoshita Shop

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:35.170
As soon as practice is over,
this doesn't concern me.

00:09:36.100 --> 00:09:38.490
Hey, this is the game
Kenma was talking about.

00:09:38.490 --> 00:09:41.720
I keep losing to this thing no
matter how many times I play.

00:09:41.720 --> 00:09:42.810
Ryu!

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:46.480
I'll get revenge for you!

00:09:46.480 --> 00:09:50.560
Heal

00:09:52.520 --> 00:09:55.210
He got hit with every single attack.

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:56.590
That's actually sort of amazing.

00:09:56.590 --> 00:09:58.490
Way to go, genius libero, I guess.

00:09:58.490 --> 00:10:03.280
So you just have cut down the enemy
without getting hit, right?

00:10:03.280 --> 00:10:05.500
Heh. Easier said than done, my friend.

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:11.790
Heal

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:20.160
You jackass! Who the hell
do you think you are?!

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:22.600
Hey! I just said I was borrowing that!

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:27.530
I guess the same thing that happens
in volleyball happened...

00:10:27.530 --> 00:10:30.060
So this is Kageyama's true nature.

00:10:30.060 --> 00:10:31.580
I'll kill you, Hinata!

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:33.340
Come on, now, Kageyama.

00:10:33.340 --> 00:10:37.030
You know you end up the
loser if you get mad.

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:39.130
Give it here.

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:42.200
Heal

00:10:41.510 --> 00:10:44.310
You see that? It's my impregnable defense!

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:48.100
Well, yeah, you're not going to lose, but...

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:51.400
Is that even fun?

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:54.840
Heal

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:59.990
Stay back! Please! Get away!

00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:02.760
It wouldn't be much of a game if it didn't.

00:11:01.080 --> 00:11:03.160
Stay away!

00:11:02.760 --> 00:11:05.230
Yeah, I knew this would happen.

00:11:05.230 --> 00:11:07.520
Hey! Can I play next?

00:11:12.870 --> 00:11:16.840
What are you? A five-year-old
that just got his first game?

00:11:18.390 --> 00:11:19.950
This is so hard...

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:24.780
It gets your blood boiling...
because it's difficult, right?

00:11:26.530 --> 00:11:28.080
Yeah! One more time!

00:11:28.080 --> 00:11:30.410
Hey! It's my turn next!

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:47.680
Sakanoshita Shop

00:11:30.410 --> 00:11:33.560
You get to play at home, Ryu!
Let me get my revenge!

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:35.210
No, leave it to me!

00:11:35.210 --> 00:11:36.360
M-M-Me, too! Me, too!

00:11:36.360 --> 00:11:38.040
Wait! I should get a turn!

00:11:38.040 --> 00:11:40.030
You've got no chance, Kageyama-kun.

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:42.330
Hinata, you little jerk!

00:11:42.330 --> 00:11:43.610
Stop dodging me!

00:11:44.050 --> 00:11:47.680
Shut up! Hurry up and go home for dinner!

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:54.690
Haikyu!!

00:11:54.690 --> 00:12:00.150
Volleyball Team
(Boys)

00:12:06.310 --> 00:12:07.850
Heyo!

00:12:06.620 --> 00:12:09.160
Nice and Tidy

00:12:07.850 --> 00:12:09.160
Mornin'!

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.530
Whoa, what the hell?

00:12:11.530 --> 00:12:13.370
Huh? What do you mean?

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:13.620
No outside
shoes

00:12:13.370 --> 00:12:17.320
Well, you've never shown up first...

00:12:17.320 --> 00:12:18.410
Hey.

00:12:18.410 --> 00:12:19.300
Morning.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:23.050
Mornin', Kenma-san!

00:12:23.840 --> 00:12:24.920
Morning...

00:12:24.920 --> 00:12:26.750
Let's hurry to the gym.

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:32.730
Please give me some tosses.
I only have a week left to become the ace.

00:12:33.050 --> 00:12:34.900
Well, aren't you popular, Kenma?

00:12:41.570 --> 00:12:43.470
Hell yeah!

00:12:42.430 --> 00:12:43.470
Nice kill!

00:12:43.470 --> 00:12:45.780
Get me the perfect toss!

00:12:51.110 --> 00:12:53.620
Huh? That's weird.

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:57.160
Lev, you're putting too much force into it.

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:58.920
Keep your eye on the ball.

00:12:58.560 --> 00:13:01.090
Was it a bit too early?

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:00.070
Okay!

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:07.580
This time, it was too late.

00:13:07.580 --> 00:13:10.660
Kenma-san! Could you do
the tosses a bit faster?

00:13:17.120 --> 00:13:17.850
Well?

00:13:18.820 --> 00:13:19.800
What?

00:13:20.370 --> 00:13:22.900
Lev's pretty interesting, huh?

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:26.480
Well, you don't have to
actually deal with him.

00:13:26.480 --> 00:13:29.950
His timing when he jumps is different
every time, so is his point of impact.

00:13:29.950 --> 00:13:32.660
I have no idea what kind
of tosses to give him.

00:13:34.190 --> 00:13:36.170
You still can't beat that enemy?

00:13:36.170 --> 00:13:40.030
Its attack is super strong and
he takes me out instantly.

00:13:40.030 --> 00:13:43.550
But once you beat it, it's all over,

00:13:43.550 --> 00:13:47.160
so don't you get more fired up when
it's an enemy you can't beat?

00:13:47.160 --> 00:13:50.740
But it's no fun if you
can't beat it, either.

00:13:55.120 --> 00:13:58.540
Can't you just attack it
before it attacks you?

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:02.410
They say offense is the best defense.

00:14:02.410 --> 00:14:05.740
That thing's tail was glowing
right before it attacked.

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.490
What? No way.

00:14:08.900 --> 00:14:11.490
What? You didn't notice?

00:14:12.480 --> 00:14:15.050
I figured you'd notice something like that.

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:18.120
I guess even you can't see everything
around you when you get worked up.

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:22.590
I'm not getting worked up.

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:24.810
You are, though.

00:14:24.810 --> 00:14:26.170
Am not.

00:14:27.090 --> 00:14:27.770
You are.

00:14:27.770 --> 00:14:29.050
Nope.

00:14:36.600 --> 00:14:38.890
I figured you'd notice something like that.

00:14:48.770 --> 00:14:50.490
Okay, today's the day!

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:56.140
Those two are having a hard
time getting in synch.

00:14:53.430 --> 00:14:55.190
Dang it!

00:15:05.060 --> 00:15:07.720
Kenma-san's noticing me!

00:15:07.720 --> 00:15:10.660
That must mean he's finally
acknowledging my talent!

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:13.850
He's just mad that you're
not progressing at all.

00:15:13.850 --> 00:15:14.680
Huh?!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:16.880
Are you mad, Kenma-san?

00:15:16.880 --> 00:15:18.930
Yeah, half of it's anger.

00:15:19.240 --> 00:15:21.180
Is he really going to be okay?

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:24.000
You keep changing your timing,
so it's hard to match you.

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:25.610
No need to rush. He's
progressing like he should.

00:15:24.000 --> 00:15:29.440
I promise I'll get it next
time! Leave it to me!

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:28.780
Now, we just have to make sure it sticks.

00:15:29.440 --> 00:15:32.940
First, could you actually
get your receives to me?

00:15:38.880 --> 00:15:41.330
Hey! We're gonna go on ahead!

00:15:41.330 --> 00:15:42.810
Sure!

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:44.650
You can go ahead.

00:15:44.650 --> 00:15:48.300
Nah, I need to work harder
to match you, Kenma-san.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:52.260
I have to become Nekoma's ace.

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:06.430
Hey, it's the cat from the other day.

00:16:06.430 --> 00:16:07.980
You can't get down?

00:16:07.980 --> 00:16:10.220
How'd you get up there anyway?

00:16:10.220 --> 00:16:12.610
Can you actually reach that high by jumping.

00:16:12.920 --> 00:16:15.500
Piece of cake. Leave it to me.

00:16:15.920 --> 00:16:17.460
Ready, and..

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:20.790
Ow!

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:26.360
He can actually reach that height?

00:16:27.760 --> 00:16:29.750
Ow...

00:16:30.840 --> 00:16:35.020
Well, of course it's gonna get scared
and scratch you if you do it that way.

00:16:35.020 --> 00:16:36.720
What should we do, Kenma-san?

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:44.010
Ready, and...

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:46.400
Can you reach it?

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:47.950
A little more to the right.

00:16:47.950 --> 00:16:48.820
'Kay.

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:52.440
Come on. Come here.

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:57.360
It's no use. It's totally spooked.

00:16:57.360 --> 00:17:00.000
Maybe I shouldn't have done that earlier.

00:17:00.000 --> 00:17:01.310
I'm done.

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:03.370
Huh? What are you talking about?!

00:17:03.690 --> 00:17:05.920
I don't like animals anyway.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:06.910
Huh? But—

00:17:06.910 --> 00:17:08.090
Just let me down.

00:17:08.090 --> 00:17:10.040
We can't just leave it up there!

00:17:10.720 --> 00:17:12.560
Sorry, I got ahead of myself.

00:17:12.560 --> 00:17:14.970
You don't need to worry
about stuff like that.

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:16.950
I'm gonna get Kuroo and the others.

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:26.630
I can't reach...

00:17:33.220 --> 00:17:35.200
Whoa, that was close!

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:39.580
Hey! Stop freaking out!

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:53.920
Are you okay, Kenma-san?

00:17:54.680 --> 00:17:58.010
No. I'm not okay at all.

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:03.720
My bad. But hey, the cat's okay
and that's what matters.

00:18:11.160 --> 00:18:14.230
Hey! What're you guys doing down there?

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:17.180
We came back because
you were taking so long!

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:19.200
Hurry up and get up here, damn it!

00:18:19.560 --> 00:18:22.600
We're running out of time to use the gym!

00:18:23.700 --> 00:18:25.500
We'll be right there!

00:18:26.710 --> 00:18:27.620
Gah!

00:18:28.030 --> 00:18:30.590
Why the hell do you both have bloody noses?!

00:18:30.590 --> 00:18:31.920
Lev did this.

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.960
Huh?! You guys got in a fight?!

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:34.800
N-No—

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:38.620
Don't go hurting our precious setter!

00:18:53.970 --> 00:18:55.480
Here's the next one.

00:18:56.100 --> 00:18:58.460
Hey, our match is about to start!

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:05.380
He's selfish and impossible to understand.

00:19:07.240 --> 00:19:08.410
But...

00:19:13.520 --> 00:19:15.260
Let's do this!

00:19:17.410 --> 00:19:21.530
So don't you get more fired up
when it's an enemy you can't beat?

00:19:25.520 --> 00:19:26.430
He's sort of...

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:29.560
Like Shoyo.

00:19:30.130 --> 00:19:30.890
Maybe.

00:19:44.840 --> 00:19:45.410
So high!

00:19:59.960 --> 00:20:01.050
The ace...

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:03.130
has opened his eyes!

00:20:06.600 --> 00:20:08.750
Okay. One more.

00:20:08.750 --> 00:20:10.680
I'll hit as many as you like!

00:20:17.540 --> 00:20:20.030
So it was totally luck!

00:20:20.030 --> 00:20:23.560
I can't lose! Kenma-san, can I go next?

00:20:23.560 --> 00:20:26.200
Hey, no fair! The senpai gets to go first!

00:20:26.520 --> 00:20:29.290
Kenma, toss to me since I'm the ace!

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:31.600
Hey! This is my practice!

00:20:31.600 --> 00:20:33.100
No, me!

00:20:33.100 --> 00:20:35.790
Guys! We're about to do a match!

00:20:37.160 --> 00:20:40.760
Looks like there's some
new blood moving, finally.

00:20:41.320 --> 00:20:42.380
Greetings!

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:44.540
Thanks for having us!

00:20:46.840 --> 00:20:49.810
Nekoma                                              Kunihira

00:20:52.130 --> 00:20:53.910
We're like the blood in our veins.

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:56.480
We need to keep flowing without stopping.

00:20:56.880 --> 00:20:58.360
Keep the oxygen moving

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:01.900
to keep our brains working properly!

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:05.240
Wh-What the heck was that?

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:07.960
We're getting pumped up! Duh!

00:21:09.700 --> 00:21:12.380
What? You've got a problem with that?

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:15.080
I actually agree with Lev on this.

00:21:16.550 --> 00:21:18.540
All right, let's do this!

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:19.900
Yeah!

00:22:50.710 --> 00:22:52.180
You dumbass!

00:22:53.760 --> 00:22:55.770
Damn it!

00:22:57.460 --> 00:23:01.050
I guess it's no use. I don't
think we're gonna beat it.

00:23:02.770 --> 00:23:06.620
I guess you really do suck at everything
other than volleyball, Your Highness.

00:23:07.090 --> 00:23:09.360
Tsukki's great at video games, too!

00:23:09.360 --> 00:23:10.860
Shut up, Yamaguchi.

00:23:10.860 --> 00:23:12.450
My bad, Tsukki!

00:23:12.810 --> 00:23:16.910
Oh, really? Then let's see
just how good you are.

00:23:16.910 --> 00:23:19.660
Hey, hang on. It's my turn next.

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:21.000
I get to go first.

00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:22.840
You just played!

00:23:23.290 --> 00:23:27.070
We already went through everyone
again! And your turn is done!

00:23:27.070 --> 00:23:28.430
I'm not done yet!

00:23:27.510 --> 00:23:29.050
Hey, stop that, you two!

00:23:28.430 --> 00:23:29.050
Huh?!

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:31.260
You just died!

00:23:31.260 --> 00:23:33.680
This turn doesn't count!
Tsukishima got in my way!

00:23:31.650 --> 00:23:33.980
Damn it! I told you I'm borrowing that!

00:23:33.680 --> 00:23:36.480
Nuh uh! You just died!

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:38.020
Let go, jackass!

00:23:36.520 --> 00:23:39.390
Hey, stop! Daichi's gonna lose it!

00:23:38.920 --> 00:23:40.730
You let go!

00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:08.280
Shut up! Go home, damn it!
